  "metadata": {
    "title": "Deep-tissue label-free quantitative optical tomography",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.4138957",
    "publication_date": "2020-10-27",
    "description": "<p>Deep-tissue label-free quantitative optical tomography</p>\n\n<p>Jelle van der Horst, Anna K. Trull, and Jeroen Kalkman</p>\n\n<p>The data sets, software, and figures accompany the publication:</p>\n\n<p>&quot;Deep-tissue label-free quantitative optical tomography&quot;, Optica 7, 1682 (2020)&nbsp; <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1364/OPTICA.397549\">https://doi.org/10.1364/OPTICA.397549</a></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>calc_hilbert_cor.m, corrects OCT data for dispersion</li>\n\t<li>cascade_measurement.m, analysis of OCT reference data&lt;\\li&gt;</li>\n\t<li>data_A2_polyfit_v1_slice_0198.zip, Peak fitted data for all 200 slices (200 files)&lt;\\li&gt;</li>\n\t<li>Ex18-11-01B, spectral-domain OCT reference data&lt;\\li&gt;</li>\n\t<li>Ex18-11-01D, spectral-domain OCT reference data for background&lt;\\li&gt;</li>\n\t<li>Ex18-11-01E_sweep_0001.dat, Reference power distribution of a sweep&lt;\\li&gt;</li>\n\t<li>loadframes_refdata.m, load spectral-domain OCT data&lt;\\li&gt;</li>\n\t<li>manual_COR_correction.m, perform manual center of rotation correction&lt;\\li&gt;</li>\n\t<li>run_frame_analysis_polyfit.m, fit spatial-domain OCT data&lt;\\li&gt;</li>\n\t<li>run_tomo_ocpt.m, main MATLAB file for the reconstruction &lt;\\li&gt;</li>\n\t<li>shift_correction_galvo.m, correction for galvo offset&lt;\\li&gt;</li>\n</ul>",
